            <video:title>₹10 Chai — Chaiwala Earnings? — How much does a chaiwala keep from a ₹10 cup?</video:title>
            <video:description>Jagruk Chacha opens his red diary to break down where every rupee of a ₹10 cup of chai goes. Milk, sugar, tea leaves, gas and the cup add up to ~₹4.50, leaving ~₹5.50 per cup — but the real money is in the ~500 cups sold every day. No investment advice — just pure explanation of the hidden economics.</video:description>
